1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:02,940
(Leonard:)your stuff back into your
account and then be on our way.

2
00:00:02,940 --> 00:00:05,480
(Leonard:)No one's bat'lething anybody.

3
00:00:06,410 --> 00:00:09,350
(Sheldon:)So my blade shall not
taste blood tonight?

4
00:00:09,350 --> 00:00:11,880
(Leonard:)No.

5
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:15,490
(Sheldon:)Well, now I just feel silly
holding it.

6
00:00:15,490 --> 00:00:17,150
(Leonard:)Come on.

7
00:00:17,150 --> 00:00:19,990
(Sheldon:)Can I at least
kick down the door?

8
00:00:19,990 --> 00:00:22,460
(Leonard:)You're welcome to try, but
the other day, it took you

9
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:25,400
(Leonard:)15 minutes to get
into a FedEx box.

10
00:00:27,830 --> 00:00:28,770
(doorbell rings)

11
00:00:28,770 --> 00:00:29,930
MAN:
Who is it?

12
00:00:29,930 --> 00:00:31,730
(Sheldon:)Your doom!

13
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:33,040
Don't say "your doom."

14
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:35,440
(Raj:)Who opens the door
for their doom?

15
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:36,810
(Sheldon:)Good point.

16
00:00:36,810 --> 00:00:38,810
(Sheldon:)Basket of puppies.

17
00:00:41,410 --> 00:00:42,550
(Policeman:)What?

18
00:00:42,550 --> 00:00:44,210
(Leonard:)Uh...

19
00:00:45,150 --> 00:00:47,080
(Leonard:)Sheldon?

20
00:00:48,890 --> 00:00:51,250
(Sheldon:)Are you Todd Zarnecki?

21
00:00:51,260 --> 00:00:52,890
(Todd:)Yeah. Who are you?

22
00:00:52,890 --> 00:00:55,090
(Sheldon:)I am Sheldor of Azeroth.

23
00:00:55,090 --> 00:00:56,730
(Sheldon:)I want my things back.

24
00:00:56,730 --> 00:00:57,860
(Todd:)I don't think so.

25
00:00:57,860 --> 00:00:59,060
(Todd:)Let me see that.

26
00:00:59,060 --> 00:01:00,360
(Sheldon:)Careful.
That's a collectible.

